'''Sprigatito''' (Japanese: '''ニャオハ''' ''Nyahoja'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

